[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2851170710","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106073#issuecomment-2851170710","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106073","id":2851170710,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p8WmW","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T14:20:08Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T14:20:08Z","body":"This is already tracked in:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/93758\n\nSee also:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/96248\n\nThis is apparently by design, CC @aaronfranke ","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2851170710/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2851962394","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106073#issuecomment-2851962394","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106073","id":2851962394,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p_X4a","user":{"login":"Azzara","id":1223554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara","html_url":"https://github.com/Azzara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T18:31:37Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T18:31:37Z","body":"I would prefer it if \"Import as Skeleton Bones: OFF\" simply doesn't rename bones, like it didn't before the feature existed.\n\nMy workflow is to import each Blender collection as a single GLB file into Godot.\nI don't export single files because it is too much work to configure the import settings of each file in Godot and I don't know how to do that in code or how to import everything without selecting each file and clicking \"Import\".\nInstead I have a post-import script in Godot which splits the assets into their own scene files and saves them where they belong (based on my personal preferences and heuristics).\n\nAsset packs can be huge. What is the intended approach which avoids clicking \"Import\" 1000+ times?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2851962394/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2851977572","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106073#issuecomment-2851977572","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106073","id":2851977572,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6p_blk","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-05T18:38:03Z","updated_at":"2025-05-05T18:38:03Z","body":"@Azzara It is intended to make names unique regardless of that setting. However, perhaps we need to change this to per-skeleton uniqueness. I don't think the cases of multiple skeletons have been extensively tested. Note that this gets tricky for skeletons with bone attachments, since they are nodes as well, and so need to be considered in both checks and kept in sync.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2851977572/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2854244203","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106073#issuecomment-2854244203","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106073","id":2854244203,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qIE9r","user":{"login":"Azzara","id":1223554,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMjM1NTQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1223554?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara","html_url":"https://github.com/Azzara","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Azzara/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-06T11:35:17Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T11:35:17Z","body":"@aaronfranke I haven't discovered any problems with having multiple skeletons in Godot 4.2 (yet). I often have multiple rigged objects in the same collection - capes, bows, characters, etc.\n\nI don't have a strong oppinion on bone attachments. I went out of my way to remove them from the MRP. Here is an example with the accessories still attached.\n[Humans_With_Hair.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/20060854/Humans_With_Hair.zip)\n\nI guess the least intrusive approach would be to not create a new bone for bone attachments at all.\nIn Blender the \"Hairstyle\" object is attached directly to the \"Head\" bone and it has its own transform. This approach could work in Godot as well, since bone attachments have their own transforms too. There is no need for the GLB-importer to append a new \"Hairstyle\" bone to the original skeleton. This would solve the potential naming conflicts even when \"Import as Skeleton Bones\" merges the skeletons.\nI'm not suggesting that the bone attachment import should be changed too, just saying that it might work.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2854244203/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2854287223","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106073#issuecomment-2854287223","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106073","id":2854287223,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6qIPd3","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-06T11:51:37Z","updated_at":"2025-05-06T11:51:37Z","body":"@Azzara Not adding an unnecessary bone to the skeleton is something I've fixed in PR https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/104184, but it's not merged yet. However we still need to handle the case regardless, because it can happen for things that are bones anyway, or sit between bones in the hierarchy. I'll take a look within the next week probably.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2854287223/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888583415","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/106073#issuecomment-2888583415","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/106073","id":2888583415,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6sLEj3","user":{"login":"aaronfranke","id":1646875,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NDY4NzU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1646875?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke","html_url":"https://github.com/aaronfranke","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aaronfranke/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-05-17T21:04:55Z","updated_at":"2025-05-17T21:04:55Z","body":"I have opened PR #106537 to fix this on import. I also made sure it works with PR #104184 (can be merged in either order).","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2888583415/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":1,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]